<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended mixed in moderate trading Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 60.21 to 6451.90.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 2.02 to 391.49.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.20.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1425 to 1037.</p>
<p>Volume was 406,776,720 compared with 440,478,650 on Friday.</p>
